---
import { profile } from "../data/portfolio.js";
---

<section class="hero" data-flow aria-labelledby="hero-name">
  <figure
    class="machine"
    aria-label="一台复古电脑，屏幕上的粒子从噪声流向“林煜轩”三个字"
  >
    <div class="machine-monitor">
      <div class="machine-bezel">
        <div class="machine-screen">
          <canvas class="screen-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
          <pre
            class="terminal"
            aria-hidden="true"
            data-terminal
          ><span>yl@lab ~ % python sample.py --prior gaussian</span>
<span>x0 ~ N(0, I)</span>
<span>integrating dx/dt = v(x, t)</span></pre>
          <p class="screen-static" data-screen-static>
            林煜轩
          </p>
          <span class="screen-t" aria-hidden="true" data-flow-value>
            t = 1.00
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="machine-panel">
        <span class="machine-badge">YL-26</span>
        <span class="machine-slot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div class="machine-controls" data-flow-control hidden>
          <label class="fader">
            <span>t</span>
            <input
              type="range"
              min="0"
              max="1"
              step="0.001"
              value="1"
              aria-label="t：从噪声（0）到字形（1）"
              aria-describedby="flow-hint"
            />
          </label>
          <button type="button" class="machine-key" data-flow-resample>
            重新采样
          </button>
        </div>
        <span class="machine-led" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="machine-stand" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </figure>
  <div class="hero-text">
    <h1 class="hero-name" id="hero-name">
      <span class="sr-only">林煜轩 </span>Yuxuan Lin
    </h1>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <p class="hero-role">Computer Engineering @ Columbia</p>
      <p class="hero-intro">{profile.intro}</p>
    </div>
    <p class="hero-hint" id="flow-hint">
      屏幕上的名字由粒子写成：它们从高斯噪声出发，沿速度场流向字形，就像 Flow
      Matching 把噪声变成数据。推动机身上的 t，看看中间的每一步。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="../scripts/flow.js"></script>
